			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I loved the sparkles until they were co-opted by tech hype! 🥲</p><p>In all seriousness, I don’t love the visual design of the “silhouette” icons. It’s really difficult to portray overlap in silhouette in the space of a glyph, so designers add shading, which barely helps readability, but also makes the figures look like faceless mannequins. 🫂</p>",
