			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Honestly my main problem is that Unicode is way too slow to add new relevant ones.</p><p>Apparently an orca was just added and will be usable late next year – way after we needed it. Similar lack for a lot of other animals, too.</p><p>Also the Unicode Consortium seems prude and boring? There's still no hemp leaf, no snorting nose and neither a butt nor a vagina or penis – tho I just learned from this thread that there's a penis hieroglyph? Doesn't work on my system tho, so 🤷</p>",
